    <string name="privacy_url" translatable="false">https://github.com/ComplexProgrammer/ip/blob/master/PRIVACY_POLICY.md</string>
    <string name="privacy_text">• The app has no account and does not collect your name, contacts or files.\n\n• IP addresses and domains you look up are sent to ipapi.co, or to ipwho.is if the first service fails, only to get their location data.\n\n• Lookup history and settings are stored only on your device. You can clear the history at any time.\n\n• Ads are served by Google AdMob, which may use the advertising ID. Crash reports and anonymous usage statistics are collected by Firebase to fix bugs.\n\n• Network tools (ping, DNS, WHOIS, ports) connect directly from your device to the host you enter.</string>
